---
description: Prepare one generateDirections evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: BrandConstraint[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Develop materially different creative directions with coherent naming, tone, and message logic. Explain what each direction emphasizes and excludes, avoid cosmetic variants of one idea, and keep unsupported product promises outside the creative system. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
